  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 4th level, the guide develops a supernatural sense of danger. While in her bauble form a guide gains the all-around vision monsters ability. In addition, a guide always get to act during an enemy’s surprise round. Furthermore, she may elect to grant her ability to act during the surprise round to an ally adjacent to her at the start of combat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/guide#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
